{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Absorb, evolve, and conquer in this bite-sized arcade experience.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Rogue Cell</i> is a short and satisfying arcade-like game about evolving your way up the microscopic food chain. You\u2019ll swim through the dynamic primordial soup, absorbing other Cells and Mass to earn DNA, avoiding hazards and defeating stronger Cells, and upgrading and evolving on a path to become the biggest and toughest organism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for quick, complete sessions, <i>Rogue Cell</i> is a compact experience designed to be finished in one or two sittings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602010/extras/b52c81137ce33aedab61fc327e86770c.poster.avif?t=1774108975\" width=800 height=534 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602010/extras/b52c81137ce33aedab61fc327e86770c.webm?t=1774108975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602010/extras/b52c81137ce33aedab61fc327e86770c.mp4?t=1774108975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, fluid movement with arcade-style controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ upgrades to collect and evolve your Cell</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short, focused gameplay designed to be finished in 1\u20132 hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized visuals with a (toggleable) retro pixelation effect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter and defeat the final Boss Cell at the top of the food chain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Competitive Arcade Mode with high scores to beat</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upcoming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're currently working on Update 1.1, which will introduce a few quality of life features and a New Game+ mode for a new challenge. Stay tuned via the News tab for details.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Absorbed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602010/a2117e2f75ab03946e9a96d2c29e493cb64b2659.jpg"},{"name":"Two For One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602010/2d0a26e2a6e62cbe5143ed81429d49cbcd301af9.jpg"},{"name":"It's a Trap!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602010/ed7e719a665e12ab2c7f71f893843f2390a0387b.jpg"},{"name":"Immunity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602010/9ec374416e29d6738be74113f9eaec3e9134450f.jpg"},{"name":"Hard Work","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602010/3bf552a5c5874320d2e2f224d27e1562e8371652.jpg"},{"name":"Viral Shield","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602010/d4b9aa9249a924d352b435f909a2c3e0c63c2937.jpg"},{"name":"The Best Cell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602010/76cf60a224f067e2595529623b03ac572881180f.jpg"},{"name":"The Ultimate Predator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602010/d3e85b177848f2c382bdc4e959615dade52140f8.jpg"},{"name":"Score Breaker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602010/e0c08aacac8dbbeef77ec7653ef5cf47e89aff76.jpg"},{"name":"Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602010/9c11e474362468e96de03dd0d6019cd3083b9f9a.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3602010?t=1774108975","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602010/f45f26ae4bbcecdb4a6cdd4d773